    guiding: ["What is the author's purpose?", "What types of appeals does the writer employ?", "What key rhetorical devices does the writer use to achieve their purpose?", "What key figurative devices does the writer use to achieve their purpose?", "How do the rhetorical devices or figurative language elements develop the argument and affect the reader?"],
    steps: ["Read the text and annotate", "Evaluate for SOAPS and tone", "Identify rhetorical elements and figurative language", "Draft a thesis/claim statement: what is the author's purpose, and how do they convey their message?", "Outline the body paragraph"],
